{"n":68,"ayat":[{"t":"Nūn. Demi pena dan apa yang mereka tuliskan,","w":[["نٓ ۚ","noon","Nun"],["وَٱلْقَلَمِ","wal-qalami","demi qalam"],["وَمَا","wamā","dan apa"],["يَسْطُرُونَ","yasṭurūna","mereka tulis"]]},{"t":"dengan karunia Tuhanmu engkau (Muhammad) bukanlah orang gila.","w":[["مَآ","mā","tidakkah"],["أَنتَ","anta","kamu"],["بِنِعْمَةِ","biniʿ'mati","dengan ni'mat"],["رَبِّكَ","rabbika","Tuhanmu"],["بِمَجْنُونٍۢ","bimajnūnin","orang gila"]]},{"t":"Dan sesungguhnya engkau pasti mendapat pahala yang besar yang tidak putus-putusnya.","w":[["وَإِنَّ","wa-inna","dan sesungguhnya"],["لَكَ","laka","bagimu"],["لَأَجْرًا","la-ajran","benar-benar pahala"],["غَيْرَ","ghayra","bukan/tidak"],["مَمْنُونٍۢ","mamnūnin","terputus-putus"]]},{"t":"Dan sesungguhnya engkau benar-benar, berbudi pekerti yang luhur.","w":[["وَإِنَّكَ","wa-innaka","dan sesungguhnya kamu"],["لَعَلَىٰ","laʿalā","benar-benar di atas"],["خُلُقٍ","khuluqin","budi pekerti"],["عَظِيمٍۢ","ʿaẓīmin","luhur/agung"]]},{"t":"Maka kelak engkau akan melihat dan mereka (orang-orang kafir) pun akan melihat,","w":[["فَسَتُبْصِرُ","fasatub'ṣiru","maka kelak kamu akan melihat"],["وَيُبْصِرُونَ","wayub'ṣirūna","dan mereka akan melihat"]]},{"t":"siapa diantara kamu yang gila?","w":[["بِأَييِّكُمُ","bi-ayyikumu","siapa diantara kamu"],["ٱلْمَفْتُونُ","l-maftūnu","yang di uji/gila"]]},{"t":"Sungguh, Tuhanmu, Dialah yang paling mengetahui siapa yang sesat dari jalan-Nya; dan Dialah yang paling mengetahui siapa orang yang mendapat petunjuk.","w":[["إِنَّ","inna","sesungguhnya"],["رَبَّكَ","rabbaka","Tuhanmu"],["هُوَ","huwa","Dia"],["أَعْلَمُ","aʿlamu","lebih mengetahui"],["بِمَن","biman","pada siapa"],["ضَلَّ","ḍalla","ia sesat"],["عَن","ʿan","dari"],["سَبِيلِهِۦ","sabīlihi","jalan-Nya"],["وَهُوَ","wahuwa","dan Dia"],["أَعْلَمُ","aʿlamu","lebih mengetahui"],["بِٱلْمُهْتَدِينَ","bil-muh'tadīna","terhadap orang-orang yang mendapat petunjuk"]]},{"t":"Maka janganlah engkau patuhi orang-orang yang mendustakan (ayat-ayat Allah).","w":[["فَلَا","falā","maka jangan"],["تُطِعِ","tuṭiʿi","kamu taati"],["ٱلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","l-mukadhibīna","orang-orang yang mendustakan"]]},{"t":"Mereka menginginkan agar engkau bersikap lunak maka mereka bersikap lunak (pula).","w":[["وَدُّوا۟","waddū","mereka menginginkan"],["لَوْ","law","sekiranya/supaya"],["تُدْهِنُ","tud'hinu","kamu bersikap lemah lembut"],["فَيُدْهِنُونَ","fayud'hinūna","maka mereka akan bersikap lemah lembut"]]},{"t":"Dan janganlah engkau patuhi setiap orang yang suka bersumpah dan suka menghina,","w":[["وَلَا","walā","dan jangan"],["تُطِعْ","tuṭiʿ","kamu taati"],["كُلَّ","kulla","setiap"],["حَلَّافٍۢ","ḥallāfin","banyak bersumpah"],["مَّهِينٍ","mahīnin","yang hina"]]},{"t":"suka mencela, yang kian ke mari menyebarkan fitnah,","w":[["هَمَّازٍۢ","hammāzin","pencela"],["مَّشَّآءٍۭ","mashāin","berjalan"],["بِنَمِيمٍۢ","binamīmin","dengan fitnah"]]},{"t":"yang merintangi segala yang baik, yang melampaui batas dan banyak dosa,","w":[["مَّنَّاعٍۢ","mannāʿin","menghalangi"],["لِّلْخَيْرِ","lil'khayri","bagi kebaikan"],["مُعْتَدٍ","muʿ'tadin","melampaui batas"],["أَثِيمٍ","athīmin","dosa"]]},{"t":"yang bertabiat kasar, selain itu juga terkenal kejahatannya,","w":[["عُتُلٍّۭ","ʿutullin","kaku kasar"],["بَعْدَ","baʿda","sesudah"],["ذَٰلِكَ","dhālika","demikian itu"],["زَنِيمٍ","zanīmin","terkenal jahat"]]},{"t":"karena dia kaya dan banyak anak.","w":[["أَن","an","karena"],["كَانَ","kāna","dia adalah"],["ذَا","dhā","mempunyai"],["مَالٍۢ","mālin","harta"],["وَبَنِينَ","wabanīna","dan anak-anak"]]},{"t":"Apabila ayat-ayat Kami dibacakan kepadanya, dia berkata, \"(Ini adalah) dongeng-dongeng orang dahulu.\"","w":[["إِذَا","idhā","apabila"],["تُتْلَىٰ","tut'lā","dibacakan"],["عَلَيْهِ","ʿalayhi","kepadanya"],["ءَايَـٰتُنَا","āyātunā","ayat-ayat Kami"],["قَالَ","qāla","dia berkata"],["أَسَـٰطِيرُ","asāṭīru","dongeng-dongeng"],["ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","l-awalīna","orang-orang terdahulu"]]},{"t":"Kelak dia akan Kami beri tanda pada belalai(nya).","w":[["سَنَسِمُهُۥ","sanasimuhu","kelak akan Kami beri tanda dia"],["عَلَى","ʿalā","atas"],["ٱلْخُرْطُومِ","l-khur'ṭūmi","belalai"]]},{"t":"Sungguh, Kami telah menguji mereka (orang musyrik Mekkah) sebagaimana Kami telah menguji pemilik-pemilik kebun, ketika mereka bersumpah pasti akan memetik (hasil)nya pada pagi hari,","w":[["إِنَّا","innā","sesungguhnya Kami"],["بَلَوْنَـٰهُمْ","balawnāhum","Kami telah menguji mereka"],["كَمَا","kamā","sebagaimana"],["بَلَوْنَآ","balawnā","Kami telah menguji"],["أَصْحَـٰبَ","aṣḥāba","penghuni/pemilik"],["ٱلْجَنَّةِ","l-janati","surga"],["إِذْ","idh","ketika"],["أَقْسَمُوا۟","aqsamū","mereka bersumpah"],["لَيَصْرِمُنَّهَا","layaṣrimunnahā","sungguh mereka akan mematikannya"],["مُصْبِحِينَ","muṣ'biḥīna","di pagi hari"]]},{"t":"tetapi mereka tidak mengecualikan (dengan mengucapkan, \"Insya Allah\").","w":[["وَلَا","walā","dan tidak"],["يَسْتَثْنُونَ","yastathnūna","mereka menyisihkan"]]},{"t":"Lalu kebun itu ditimpa bencana (yang datang) dari Tuhanmu ketika mereka sedang tidur.","w":[["فَطَافَ","faṭāfa","maka mengepung"],["عَلَيْهَا","ʿalayhā","atasnya (kebun itu)"],["طَآئِفٌۭ","ṭāifun","kepungan (malapetaka)"],["مِّن","min","dari"],["رَّبِّكَ","rabbika","Tuhanmu"],["وَهُمْ","wahum","dan mereka"],["نَآئِمُونَ","nāimūna","orang-orang yang tidur"]]},{"t":"Maka jadilah kebun itu hitam seperti malam yang gelap gulita,","w":[["فَأَصْبَحَتْ","fa-aṣbaḥat","maka jadilah ia/kebun itu"],["كَٱلصَّرِيمِ","kal-ṣarīmi","seperti sudah di potong/petik"]]},{"t":"lalu pada pagi hari mereka saling memanggil.","w":[["فَتَنَادَوْا۟","fatanādaw","maka mereka panggil memanggil"],["مُصْبِحِينَ","muṣ'biḥīna","di pagi hari"]]},{"t":"\"Pergilah pagi-pagi ke kebunmu jika kamu hendak memetik hasil.\"","w":[["أَنِ","ani","sesungguhnya"],["ٱغْدُوا۟","igh'dū","pergi diwaktu pagi"],["عَلَىٰ","ʿalā","atas"],["حَرْثِكُمْ","ḥarthikum","kebunmu"],["إِن","in","jika"],["كُنتُمْ","kuntum","kalian adalah"],["صَـٰرِمِينَ","ṣārimīna","orang-orang yang memotong/memetik"]]},{"t":"Maka mereka pun berangkat sambil berbisik-bisik.","w":[["فَٱنطَلَقُوا۟","fa-inṭalaqū","maka mereka berjalan/pergi"],["وَهُمْ","wahum","dan mereka"],["يَتَخَـٰفَتُونَ","yatakhāfatūna","mereka saling berbisik"]]},{"t":"\"Pada hari ini jangan sampai ada orang miskin masuk ke dalam kebunmu.\"","w":[["أَن","an","bahwa"],["لَّا","lā","jangan"],["يَدْخُلَنَّهَا","yadkhulannahā","sekali-kali memasukinya"],["ٱلْيَوْمَ","l-yawma","hari ini"],["عَلَيْكُم","ʿalaykum","atas kalian"],["مِّسْكِينٌۭ","mis'kīnun","seorang miskin"]]},{"t":"Dan berangkatlah mereka di pagi hari dengan niat menghalangi (orang-orang miskin) padahal mereka mampu (menolongnya).","w":[["وَغَدَوْا۟","waghadaw","dan mereka pergi pagi-pagi"],["عَلَىٰ","ʿalā","atas"],["حَرْدٍۢ","ḥardin","mencegah/menghalangi"],["قَـٰدِرِينَ","qādirīna","orang-orang yang mampu"]]},{"t":"Maka ketika mereka melihat kebun itu, mereka berkata, \"Sungguh, kita ini benar-benar orang-orang yang sesat,","w":[["فَلَمَّا","falammā","maka tatkala"],["رَأَوْهَا","ra-awhā","mereka melihatnya"],["قَالُوٓا۟","qālū","mereka berkata"],["إِنَّا","innā","sesungguhnya Kami"],["لَضَآلُّونَ","laḍāllūna","benar-benar orang-orang yang sesat"]]},{"t":"bahkan kita tak memperoleh apa pun.\"","w":[["بَلْ","bal","bahkan"],["نَحْنُ","naḥnu","kami"],["مَحْرُومُونَ","maḥrūmūna","orang-orang yang menghalangi"]]},{"t":"Berkatalah seorang yang paling bijak di antara mereka, \"Bukankah aku telah mengatakan kepadamu, mengapa kamu tidak bertasbih (kepada Tuhanmu).\"","w":[["قَالَ","qāla","berkata"],["أَوْسَطُهُمْ","awsaṭuhum","paling baik antara mereka"],["أَلَمْ","alam","tidakkah"],["أَقُل","aqul","aku katakan"],["لَّكُمْ","lakum","bagi kalian"],["لَوْلَا","lawlā","mengapa tidak"],["تُسَبِّحُونَ","tusabbiḥūna","kamu bertasbih"]]},{"t":"Mereka mengucapkan, \"Mahasuci Tuhan kami, sungguh, kami adalah orang-orang yang zalim.\"","w":[["قَالُوا۟","qālū","mereka berkata"],["سُبْحَـٰنَ","sub'ḥāna","Maha Suci"],["رَبِّنَآ","rabbinā","Tuhan Kami"],["إِنَّا","innā","sesungguhnya Kami"],["كُنَّا","kunnā","adalah Kami"],["ظَـٰلِمِينَ","ẓālimīna","orang-orang yang zalim"]]},{"t":"Lalu mereka saling berhadapan dan saling menyalahkan.","w":[["فَأَقْبَلَ","fa-aqbala","maka berhadapan"],["بَعْضُهُمْ","baʿḍuhum","sebagian mereka"],["عَلَىٰ","ʿalā","atas"],["بَعْضٍۢ","baʿḍin","sebagian"],["يَتَلَـٰوَمُونَ","yatalāwamūna","mereka saling cela mencela"]]},{"t":"Mereka berkata, \"Celaka kita! Sesungguhnya kita orang-orang yang melampaui batas.","w":[["قَالُوا۟","qālū","mereka berkata"],["يَـٰوَيْلَنَآ","yāwaylanā","betapa celakanya kami"],["إِنَّا","innā","sesungguhnya kami"],["كُنَّا","kunnā","adalah kami"],["طَـٰغِينَ","ṭāghīna","orang-orang yang melampaui batas"]]},{"t":"Mudah-mudahan Tuhan memberikan ganti kepada kita dengan (kebun) yang lebih baik daripada yang ini, sungguh, kita mengharapkan ampunan dari Tuhan kita.","w":[["عَسَىٰ","ʿasā","mudah-mudahan"],["رَبُّنَآ","rabbunā","Tuhan kami"],["أَن","an","akan"],["يُبْدِلَنَا","yub'dilanā","mengganti kami"],["خَيْرًۭا","khayran","lebih baik"],["مِّنْهَآ","min'hā","daripadanya"],["إِنَّآ","innā","sesungguhnya kami"],["إِلَىٰ","ilā","kepada"],["رَبِّنَا","rabbinā","Tuhan kami"],["رَٰغِبُونَ","rāghibūna","orang-orang yang mengharap"]]},{"t":"Seperti itulah azab (di dunia). Dan sungguh, azab akhirat lebih besar sekiranya mereka mengetahui.","w":[["كَذَٰلِكَ","kadhālika","seperti demikian"],["ٱلْعَذَابُ ۖ","l-ʿadhābu","siksaan/azab"],["وَلَعَذَابُ","walaʿadhābu","dan sungguh siksaan/azab"],["ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","l-ākhirati","akhirat"],["أَكْبَرُ ۚ","akbaru","lebih besar"],["لَوْ","law","jika"],["كَانُوا۟","kānū","adalah mereka"],["يَعْلَمُونَ","yaʿlamūna","mereka mengetahui"]]},{"t":"Sungguh, bagi orang-orang yang bertakwa (disediakan) surga yang penuh kenikmatan di sisi Tuhannya.","w":[["إِنَّ","inna","sesungguhnya"],["لِلْمُتَّقِينَ","lil'muttaqīna","bagi orang-orang yang bertakwa"],["عِندَ","ʿinda","di sisi"],["رَبِّهِمْ","rabbihim","Tuhan mereka"],["جَنَّـٰتِ","jannāti","surga"],["ٱلنَّعِيمِ","l-naʿīmi","kenikmatan"]]},{"t":"Apakah patut Kami memperlakukan orang-orang Islam itu seperti orang-orang yang berdosa (orang kafir)?","w":[["أَفَنَجْعَلُ","afanajʿalu","maka apakah Kami menjadikan"],["ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ","l-mus'limīna","orang-orang Islam"],["كَٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","kal-muj'rimīna","seperti orang-orang berdosa"]]},{"t":"Mengapa kamu (berbuat demikian)? Bagaimana kamu mengambil keputusan?","w":[["مَا","mā","mengapa"],["لَكُمْ","lakum","bagi kalian"],["كَيْفَ","kayfa","bagaimana"],["تَحْكُمُونَ","taḥkumūna","kamu mengambil keputusan"]]},{"t":"Atau apakah kamu mempunyai kitab (yang diturunkan Allah) yang kamu pelajari?","w":[["أَمْ","am","atau"],["لَكُمْ","lakum","bagi kalian"],["كِتَـٰبٌۭ","kitābun","kitab"],["فِيهِ","fīhi","di dalamnya"],["تَدْرُسُونَ","tadrusūna","kamu mempelajari"]]},{"t":"sesungguhnya kamu dapat memilih apa saja yang ada di dalamnya.","w":[["إِنَّ","inna","sesungguhnya"],["لَكُمْ","lakum","bagi kalian"],["فِيهِ","fīhi","di dalamnya"],["لَمَا","lamā","untuk apa-apa"],["تَخَيَّرُونَ","takhayyarūna","kamu memilih"]]},{"t":"Atau apakah kamu memperoleh (janji-janji yang diperkuat dengan) sumpah dari Kami, yang tetap berlaku sampai hari Kiamat; bahwa kamu dapat mengambil keputusan (sekehendakmu)?","w":[["أَمْ","am","atau"],["لَكُمْ","lakum","bagi kalian"],["أَيْمَـٰنٌ","aymānun","sumpah/perjanjian"],["عَلَيْنَا","ʿalaynā","atas Kami"],["بَـٰلِغَةٌ","bālighatun","teguh"],["إِلَىٰ","ilā","sampai"],["يَوْمِ","yawmi","hari"],["ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۙ","l-qiyāmati","kiamat"],["إِنَّ","inna","sesungguhnya"],["لَكُمْ","lakum","bagi kalian"],["لَمَا","lamā","terhadap apa"],["تَحْكُمُونَ","taḥkumūna","kamu putuskan"]]},{"t":"Tanyakanlah kepada mereka, \"Siapakah di antara mereka yang bertanggung jawab terhadap (keputusan yang diambil itu)?\"","w":[["سَلْهُمْ","salhum","tanyakan pada mereka"],["أَيُّهُم","ayyuhum","siapa di antara mereka"],["بِذَٰلِكَ","bidhālika","terhadap demikian itu"],["زَعِيمٌ","zaʿīmun","bertanggung jawab"]]},{"t":"Atau apakah mereka mempunyai sekutu-sekutu? Kalau begitu hendaklah mereka mendatangkan sekutu-sekutunya jika mereka orang-orang yang benar.","w":[["أَمْ","am","atau"],["لَهُمْ","lahum","bagi mereka"],["شُرَكَآءُ","shurakāu","sekutu-sekutu"],["فَلْيَأْتُوا۟","falyatū","maka hendaklah mereka mendatangkan"],["بِشُرَكَآئِهِمْ","bishurakāihim","dengan sekutu-sekutu mereka"],["إِن","in","jika"],["كَانُوا۟","kānū","mereka adalah"],["صَـٰدِقِينَ","ṣādiqīna","orang-orang yang benar"]]},{"t":"(Ingatlah) pada hari ketika betis disingkapkan dan mereka diseru untuk bersujud; maka mereka tidak mampu,","w":[["يَوْمَ","yawma","pada hari"],["يُكْشَفُ","yuk'shafu","di buka/di singkap"],["عَن","ʿan","dari"],["سَاقٍۢ","sāqin","betis"],["وَيُدْعَوْنَ","wayud'ʿawna","dan mereka di seru/di panggil"],["إِلَى","ilā","kepada/untuk"],["ٱلسُّجُودِ","l-sujūdi","bersujud"],["فَلَا","falā","maka tidak"],["يَسْتَطِيعُونَ","yastaṭīʿūna","mereka mampu/kuasa"]]},{"t":"pandangan mereka tertunduk ke bawah, diliputi kehinaan. Dan sungguh, dahulu (di dunia) mereka telah diseru untuk bersujud waktu mereka sehat (tetapi mereka tidak melakukan).","w":[["خَـٰشِعَةً","khāshiʿatan","tertunduk"],["أَبْصَـٰرُهُمْ","abṣāruhum","pandangan mereka"],["تَرْهَقُهُمْ","tarhaquhum","menimpa mereka"],["ذِلَّةٌۭ ۖ","dhillatun","kehinaan"],["وَقَدْ","waqad","dan sesungguhnya"],["كَانُوا۟","kānū","adalah mereka"],["يُدْعَوْنَ","yud'ʿawna","mereka di seru/di panggil"],["إِلَى","ilā","kepada/untuk"],["ٱلسُّجُودِ","l-sujūdi","bersujud"],["وَهُمْ","wahum","dan/sedang mereka"],["سَـٰلِمُونَ","sālimūna","orang-orang sejahtera"]]},{"t":"Maka serahkanlah kepada-Ku (urusannya) dan orang-orang yang mendustakan perkataan ini (Alquran). Kelak akan Kami hukum mereka berangsur-angsur dari arah yang tidak mereka ketahui,","w":[["فَذَرْنِى","fadharnī","maka biarkan Aku"],["وَمَن","waman","dan orang"],["يُكَذِّبُ","yukadhibu","ia mendustakan"],["بِهَـٰذَا","bihādhā","dengan ini"],["ٱلْحَدِيثِ ۖ","l-ḥadīthi","cerita/perkataan"],["سَنَسْتَدْرِجُهُم","sanastadrijuhum","kelak Kami menarik mereka berangsur-angsur"],["مِّنْ","min","dari"],["حَيْثُ","ḥaythu","sekira/secara"],["لَا","lā","tidak"],["يَعْلَمُونَ","yaʿlamūna","mereka mengetahui"]]},{"t":"dan Aku memberi tenggang waktu kepada mereka. Sungguh, rencana-Ku sangat teguh.","w":[["وَأُمْلِى","wa-um'lī","dan Aku beri waktu/tangguh"],["لَهُمْ ۚ","lahum","kepada mereka"],["إِنَّ","inna","sesungguhnya"],["كَيْدِى","kaydī","tipu daya-KU/rencana-Ku"],["مَتِينٌ","matīnun","teguh"]]},{"t":"Ataukah engkau (Muhammad) meminta imbalan kepada mereka, sehingga mereka dibebani dengan hutang?","w":[["أَمْ","am","atau"],["تَسْـَٔلُهُمْ","tasaluhum","kamu meminta mereka"],["أَجْرًۭا","ajran","upah"],["فَهُم","fahum","lalu mereka"],["مِّن","min","dari"],["مَّغْرَمٍۢ","maghramin","hutang"],["مُّثْقَلُونَ","muth'qalūna","orang-orang yang dibebani"]]},{"t":"Ataukah mereka mengetahui yang gaib, lalu mereka menuliskannya?","w":[["أَمْ","am","atau"],["عِندَهُمُ","ʿindahumu","di sisi mereka"],["ٱلْغَيْبُ","l-ghaybu","yang gaib"],["فَهُمْ","fahum","lalu mereka"],["يَكْتُبُونَ","yaktubūna","mereka menulis"]]},{"t":"Maka bersabarlah engkau (Muhammad) terhadap ketetapan Tuhanmu, dan janganlah engkau seperti (Yunus) orang yang berada dalam (perut) ikan ketika dia berdoa dengan hati sedih.","w":[["فَٱصْبِرْ","fa-iṣ'bir","maka bersabarlah"],["لِحُكْمِ","liḥuk'mi","terhadap ketetapan"],["رَبِّكَ","rabbika","Tuhanmu"],["وَلَا","walā","dan jangan"],["تَكُن","takun","kamu jadi"],["كَصَاحِبِ","kaṣāḥibi","seperti teman/orang"],["ٱلْحُوتِ","l-ḥūti","ikan"],["إِذْ","idh","ketika"],["نَادَىٰ","nādā","ia menyeru/berdo'a"],["وَهُوَ","wahuwa","dan ia"],["مَكْظُومٌۭ","makẓūmun","amat marah"]]},{"t":"Sekiranya dia tidak segera mendapat nikmat dari Tuhannya, pastilah dia dicampakkan ke tanah tandus dalam keadaan tercela.","w":[["لَّوْلَآ","lawlā","kalau tidak"],["أَن","an","karena"],["تَدَٰرَكَهُۥ","tadārakahu","mendapatkannya/ia"],["نِعْمَةٌۭ","niʿ'matun","nikmat"],["مِّن","min","dari"],["رَّبِّهِۦ","rabbihi","Tuhannya"],["لَنُبِذَ","lanubidha","tentu ia dicampakkan"],["بِٱلْعَرَآءِ","bil-ʿarāi","tanah tandus/kosong"],["وَهُوَ","wahuwa","dan ia"],["مَذْمُومٌۭ","madhmūmun","tercela"]]},{"t":"Lalu Tuhannya memilihnya dan menjadikannya termasuk orang yang saleh.","w":[["فَٱجْتَبَـٰهُ","fa-ij'tabāhu","lalu memilihnya"],["رَبُّهُۥ","rabbuhu","Tuhannya"],["فَجَعَلَهُۥ","fajaʿalahu","maka Dia menjadikannya"],["مِنَ","mina","dari/termasuk"],["ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","l-ṣāliḥīna","orang-orang yang saleh"]]},{"t":"Dan sungguh, orang-orang kafir itu hampir-hampir menggelincirkanmu dengan pandangan mata mereka, ketika mereka mendengar Alquran dan mereka berkata, \"Dia (Muhammad) itu benar-benar orang gila.\"","w":[["وَإِن","wa-in","dan sesungguhnya"],["يَكَادُ","yakādu","hampir"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","alladhīna","orang-orang yang"],["كَفَرُوا۟","kafarū","kafir/ingkar"],["لَيُزْلِقُونَكَ","layuz'liqūnaka","benar-benar akan menggelincirkan kamu"],["بِأَبْصَـٰرِهِمْ","bi-abṣārihim","dengan pandangan mereka"],["لَمَّا","lammā","tatkala"],["سَمِعُوا۟","samiʿū","mereka mendengar"],["ٱلذِّكْرَ","l-dhik'ra","peringatan/Al Qur'an"],["وَيَقُولُونَ","wayaqūlūna","dan mereka berkata"],["إِنَّهُۥ","innahu","sesungguhnya"],["لَمَجْنُونٌۭ","lamajnūnun","benar-benar orang gila"]]},{"t":"Padahal Alquran itu tidak lain adalah peringatan bagi seluruh alam.","w":[["وَمَا","wamā","dan tidaklah"],["هُوَ","huwa","ia"],["إِلَّا","illā","kecuali"],["ذِكْرٌۭ","dhik'run","peringatan/pelajaran"],["لِّلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","lil'ʿālamīna","bagi alam semesta"]]}]}